#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#In a right side-only lateral force test, force is applied in the Y direction of the sprung mass to the right side only. Its purpose is to aid in visualizing and analyzing the left/right interconnection between a pair of wheels.
#
#The tire forces in CarSim are in the tire coordinates, so these are calculated to account for any toe or steer of the wheels.
#
#Output from the test begins with force at the specified maximum value in the negative direction and runs through one complete cycle from negative to positive and back.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

